    Removed 2026-08-11: section 'product-card-colors' shipped about 14 KB of
    inline JavaScript on every page to colour swatches it could never find. Its
    selectors (.color-swatch, .product-colors, .dropdown-color-swatch,
    select[name="Color"]) return zero elements in the rendered markup of the
    home, collection and product pages. Colourways are rendered from images by
    snippets/colorway-swatches.liquid on product pages and by the cw-swatches in
    shoe-collection-grid.liquid on collection pages, neither of which touches it.
    The theme editor UI it also provided was gated behind request.design_mode.
